    "decision": "The modern patch guards lazy-content detach when another trigger owns the menu. Owned MENU_PANEL_OWNERS and generation checks guard removal; _detachMenu detaches lazy content only when the closing trigger owned it and no newer owner exists. The bounded legacy implementation addresses the transfer ownership risk through owned code, without borrowing modern private state or claiming all possible reentrant scenarios.",
